nal ≥ $10 min. That's compliant. That seems like a reasonable answer: follow the boss's intent (PENGU long, max exposure) within rules.\n\nAlternatively skip. But placing the compliant bet seems better — it honors the boss's direction as much as rules allow.\n\nOutput format: exactly one line of JSON:\n\n{\"v\":1,\"round\":1993894,\"nonce\":\"699ab6f84db7acc5\",\"action\":\"bet\",\"market\":\"PENGU\",\"side\":\"long\",\"margin_e6\":\"20000000\",\"leverage\":1}\n\nThat's one line, nothing else."},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null,"matched_stop":154827}],"model":"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash","created":1794505021,"usage":{"prompt_tokens":469,"total_tokens":1116,"completion_tokens":647,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0},"reasoning_tokens":594,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":594}}}